IT:
Per caso hai mai usato l'armadietto{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}
alla stazione?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Può servirti per
metterci le tue cose personali!
Gli armadietti delle altre città sono
collegati al nostro, così come gli
armadi e le cassettiere di casa tua!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Troppo forte, no? Fa un po' paura
a pensarci, ma è comunque troppo
forte!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Ya sabes que puedes agitar los
árboles frutales para que caiga
la fruta, ¿verdad?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}¿Has probado a agitar un árbol
que no dé fruta?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡A veces también caen objetos!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Cosas de lo más surrealista,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
¡como muebles!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡O dinero!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}En mis tiempos esto no pasaba{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}¡Ah, pero ten cuidado con las
abejas!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}¡Si cae una colmena,
más te vale salir corriendo!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Are you taking lots of pictures?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
If you want, we could go over {{TAG:0003:0017:}}how
to take a picture together, maybe?{{TAG:0008:0005:1F00150020002800}}
Teach me!
I'm good...

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¿Estás sacando muchas fotos?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Si quieres te explico cómo se hacen.{{TAG:0008:0005:1F00150020002800}}
¡Cuéntame!
Ya me apaño...

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hai già usato la fotocamera?
Spero di sì!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Vuoi che ti spieghi {{TAG:0003:0017:}}
come si fa a scattare delle foto?{{TAG:0008:0005:1F00150020002800}}
Sì, insegnami!
No, sono a posto.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bol bol fotoğraf çekiyor musun?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
İstersen {{TAG:0003:0017:}}fotoğraf nasıl çekilir birlikte
üstünden geçebiliriz, ne dersin?{{TAG:0008:0005:1F00150020002800}}
Öğret bana!
Ben iyiyim...

IT:
A volte, quando colpisci un sasso,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
si potrebbe rompere e potrebbe
uscirne un minerale.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ogni tanto, ma solo ogni tanto,
puoi trovare nientemeno che
un {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}minerale d'oro{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Se riesci a trovarne tre,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Merino
{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}di {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Ricicla e Ricrea {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}può usarli
per creare mobili d'oro!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}You{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}} have a golden shovel, right?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Then you should try planting a
tree that grows money!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}If you plant money using a golden
shovel,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} sometimes the most amazing
thing will happen.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}A money tree will grow!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}The key word here is "sometimes."{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Tú tienes una pala de oro,{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}} ¿verdad?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Entonces tienes que probar a
plantar un árbol que dé dinero!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Que no,{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}} que no estoy chocheando,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
¡escucha!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Planta unas bayas usando
la pala de oro.
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡A veces crece un árbol que
da bayas!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}El problema es ese{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}
Que solo pasa "a veces".{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Ja, ja, ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Tu{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}} hai una pala d'oro, giusto?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Allora dovresti provare a piantare
un albero che dà stelline!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Pianta soldi usando una pala d'oro.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
A volte da una moneta può nascere
un intero albero di stelline!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ehm, ricorda che ho detto "a volte".{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Senin{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}} altın küreğin var, değil mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}O zaman para yetiştiren bir ağaç dikmeyi
dene!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Altın kürekle para gömersin,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} bazen
inanılmaz bir şey olur.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Para ağacı çıkar!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Buradaki kilit kelime “bazen”.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

EN:
Have you ever made a request
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}at one of {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}K.K. Slider{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}'s concerts?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}I usually just ask for him to play a
special song for those in the know—{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}K.K. Island{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I'm sure if you ask for it,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}K.K. Slider{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} will be thinking,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0500}}"Wow, this cat knows music!"{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Alguna vez le has pedido a
{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Totakeke{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} alguna de sus canciones?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Yo en todos los conciertos le pido
que toque {{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Mi isla, mi hogar{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
No sé si la conocerás...
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Seguro que si se la pides,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Totakeke{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} se quedará pensando:{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
"¡{{TAG:000E:0006:1200450073007400650020007000610076006F0014004500730074006100200063006800690063006100}} sí que sabe de música!".

TRANSLATION:
Hiç bir {{TAG:0003:0017:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}K.K. Slider{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} konserinde şarkı
istedin mi?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ben genelde bilenlerin
bildiği özel bir parçayı isterim—{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}K.K. Island{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}İstersen eminim{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}K.K. Slider{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} şöyle düşünür,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0500}}“Vay, bu kişi müzikten anlıyor!”{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}

ES:
¿Te has enterado?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0006:}}Me refiero a ese
rumor sobre la tienda de reciclaje.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001C:}}Cuanta más gente te cruces un día,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
habrá más objetos por los que la
tienda te pagará especialmente bien.
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Pero oí que no tiene que ser gente
del pueblo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} sino de "StreetPass".{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Tú sabes lo que significa eso?
No conozco los detalles,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0026:}}pero habrá
que intentar sacarle partido a la
información.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Ja, ja, ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
